  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Delinks the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Primitive" target="_blank">prim</a> with the given <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Link" target="_blank">link</a> number in a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Link_set" target="_blank">linked object set</a></p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>LinkNumber / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/link" target="_blank">link</a></td>
          <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Link" target="_blank">Link</a> number (0: unlinked,&#32;1: <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Link#Root_Prim" target="_blank">root</a> prim, >1: child prims&#32;and seated avatars) &#32;</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
